{title: Raat Ke Humsafar}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi Asha Bhosle Shankar Jaikishan}
{key: Cm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Cm]Raat ke [Bb]humsafar, thak [Cm]ke ghar [Fm]ko chale
[Bb]Joomti [Eb]aa rahi, [G]hai subah [Cm]pyaar ki
[Cm]Dekh [Bb]kar samne [Cm]roop [Fm]ki roshni
[Bb]Phir looti [Eb]ja rahi, [G]hai subah [Cm]pyaar ki
[Fm]Sonewalon [Db]ko hutkar [Bb]jagaana [Cm]bhi hai
[Fm]Raat [Db]ke jagaton [Bb]ko sulana [Cm]bhi hai
[Cm]Deti [Ab]hai jaagne [Eb]ki sada [Cm]saath hi
[Cm]Loriyan [Bb]ga rahi [Ab]hain, subah [Cm]pyaar ki
[Cm]Raat [Bb]ke humsafar...
[Fm]Raat ne [Db]pyaar ke [Bb]jam bhar [Cm]kar diye
[Fm]Ankhon [Db]ankhon se [Bb]jo maine [Cm]tumne piye
[Cm]Hosh [Ab]to ab [Eb]talak jaake [Cm]laute nahin
[Cm]Aur kya [Bb]la rahi [Ab]hai, subah [Cm]pyaar ki
[Cm]Raat [Bb]ke humsafar...
[Fm]Kya kya [Db]wade huye, [Bb]kis ne [Cm]khayi kasam
[Fm]Is [Db]nayi raah [Bb]par, humne [Cm]rakhe kadam
[Cm]Chup saka [Ab]pyaar kab [Eb]hum chupaye [Cm]to kya
[Cm]Sab samaj [Bb]pa rahi [Ab]hain, subah [Cm]pyaar ki
[Cm]Raat [Bb]ke humsafar...
